#: ../../infrastructure/storage/file_shares.rst:273
msgid ""
"Local Storage refers to local to the |morpheus| Appliance and the path "
"must be owned by `morpheus-app`. Please be conscious of storage space. "
"High Availability configurations require Local Storage File Shares paths "
"to be shared storage paths between the font end |morpheus| Appliances."
msgstr "Local Storage refere-se ao armazenamento local do Appliance |morpheus| e o caminho deve ser de propriedade de `morpheus-app`. Fique atento ao espaço de armazenamento. Configurações de Alta Disponibilidade exigem que os caminhos de Local Storage File Shares sejam caminhos de armazenamento compartilhado entre os Appliances |morpheus| de front end."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/file_shares.rst:275
msgid ""
"To change the owner of a file path to be used as a Local Storage File "
"Share, run ``chown morpheus-app.morpheus-app /path`` on the |morpheus| "
"Appliance."
msgstr "Para alterar o proprietário de um caminho de arquivo a ser usado como Local Storage File Share, execute ``chown morpheus-app.morpheus-app /path`` no Appliance |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/file_shares.rst:277
msgid "|morpheus| will validate path and ownership of the File Share Path."
msgstr "|morpheus| validará o caminho e a propriedade do File Share Path."

